      "id": "1628fd4f42f25cc38102ba6f4c1ed6fc2392f032",
      "message": "\u2728 feat: Bind container sources to fresh filesystem identities\n\nRetain raw block probes, topology, swap, mount-table and fstab identity alongside host source descriptors. Report exact-filesystem and conservative shared-backing consumers without adding executor requests or storage effects.\n\nRefuse unavailable or duplicate UUIDs, unsupported backing evidence, changed identities, expired observations and excessive reports. Local validation passes 271 workspace tests, including 21 new storage tests, strict Clippy, generated contracts, repository boundaries, formatting and dependency policy/advisory checks.",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-07T07:34:13Z",
      "tree_id": "06bd5b01365afb7810a5ce3453bece1f496e7e1a"
    },
